## AccountService
class AccountService {
  Future<List<Account>> getAllAccounts();
  Future<void> addAccount(Account newAccount);
  Future<void> deleteAccount(String accountId);
  Future<bool> accountExists(Account account);
  Future<void> updateAccount(Account updatedAccount);
}

Note: Higher-level account management using DatabaseService. Handles duplicate checks and error translation.

