## TOTPService
class TOTPService {
  String generateTOTP(String secret);
  String generateTOTPAtTime(String secret, int unixTimeSeconds);
  bool validateTOTP(String secret, String code, {int timeSteps = 1});
  int getRemainingSeconds();
  bool validateSecret(String secret);
}

Note: Implements RFC6238 TOTP generation/validation (6-digit codes, 30s timestep) using base32 secrets and HMAC-SHA1.

---

## BackupService
class BackupService {
  Future<String> createBackup(String password);
  Future<BackupRestoreResult> restoreBackup(String filePath, String password, {MergeStrategy strategy});
  Future<BackupInfo> getBackupInfo(String filePath);
  Future<List<String>> listBackupFiles();
  Future<void> deleteBackup(String filePath);
  Future<String> getBackupDirectory();
}

Note: Creates password-protected encrypted backups (.cdac files) using Argon2id + XChaCha20-Poly1305. Supports merge strategies (skip/replace/keepBoth) for duplicate handling.

---

## GoogleAuthImportService
class GoogleAuthImportService {
  static List<ImportedAccount> parseMigrationUri(String uri);
}

Note: Parses otpauth-migration:// URIs from Google Authenticator exports. Decodes base64 protobuf data and extracts multiple accounts with their secrets, issuers, and parameters.

