## SecurityService
class SecurityService {
  Future<SecurityCheckResult> performSecurityChecks();
  Future<bool> isDeviceSecure();
  Future<String> getSecurityWarning();
  void clearCache();
}

Note: Performs device integrity checks (jailbreak/root, emulator, development mode, external storage) using safe_device package. Results are cached for performance.

---

## IntegrityService
class IntegrityService {
  Future<String?> calculateDatabaseChecksum();
  Future<void> storeDatabaseChecksum();
  Future<bool> verifyDatabaseIntegrity();
  Future<void> updateDatabaseChecksum();
  Future<void> storeAppVersion(String version);
  Future<String?> getStoredAppVersion();
  Future<void> clearIntegrityData();
}

Note: Calculates SHA256 checksums of database content to detect tampering. Updates checksums after legitimate changes.

---

## RecoveryCodesService
class RecoveryCodesService {
  Future<List<String>> generateRecoveryCodes();
  Future<bool> verifyRecoveryCode(String code);
  Future<bool> hasRecoveryCodes();
  Future<int> getRemainingCodesCount();
  Future<void> deleteRecoveryCodes();
}

Note: Generates 10 one-time recovery codes (8 characters, formatted as XXXX-XXXX). Codes are hashed with SHA256 before storage. Used for account recovery.

